'''Ren Katagiri''' (片桐恋) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ren Katagiri
|image = E 384.png
|appearance = [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has somewhat massive health compared to most collab enemies along with mediocre damage and awful range; she also possesses three knockbacks, low movement speed along with Area Attack and a 100% chance to [[Knockback]] Cat Units. Due to their similar stats, she is comparable to a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] version of [[Nimoy Bore]].

==Strategy==
She is outranged by most cats, letting you accumulate high damage on her with nukers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Additionally, her damage is low enough to knock most cats to safety. It is better to worry about the support that's accompanying her more than anything else.

